{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2021-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1629072000, "end_date": 1629763199, "month_true_total": 175, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:49:18 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "98118560", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025874950", "personaname": "NORTH", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025874950/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 96, "playtime_forever": 745, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 471, "last_played": 1652214508, "avatar": "de2a7b201d21d0a643c97f1c7a960b4f667f416b"}, "language": "english", "review": "like it", "timestamp_created": 1629759938, "timestamp_updated": 1629759938, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98117730", "author": {"steamid": "76561198033147024", "personaname": "Harken", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/body-ody-ody/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 7733, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2972, "last_played": 1774139678, "avatar": "4676daf9271cf62acf47cbc811468bbff83bffe9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is absolutely amazing. Everything feels solid, the gunplay is as fast as the movement and almost all of the weapons feel just so damned punchy and rewarding to shoot (Some of the tech weapons aren't particularly my style but only two don't really feel amazing to shoot as they're more 'support your other gun' kind of guns). It may seem deceptively simple at first until you discover what exactly you can do with builds once you get a grasp on what the possible affixes for guns are and what the best ones are for your current loadout. All in all, incredible game, beaten it on the hardest difficulty after nearly a month of trying (all that on said difficulty, not counting all the previous difficulties) and I still play it every other day for hours if not every day. The updates have been absolutely NAILING it out of the park and just making it more and more refreshing and fun to play. Much, much love to the devs, thanks for continuing to pour out your heart and immense passion and talent into this.", "timestamp_created": 1629758498, "timestamp_updated": 1629758498, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98086232", "author": {"steamid": "76561198163622457", "personaname": "parvazoa", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/parvazoa/", "num_games_owned": 387, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 382, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 189, "last_played": 1706673878, "avatar": "352361e62064a954d57d2a7ba546e3a04396b390"}, "language": "english", "review": "This was previously rated a \"no\", but I think it deserves a \"yes\" after some major updates that added new features and balanced the game a lot better.\n\nI look forward to when it can finally come out of Early Access, I really hope they add some kind of logbook of enemies, NPCs, and locations, because the game is fun but I'd like to know more about the world.", "timestamp_created": 1629715101, "timestamp_updated": 1674120408, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.490028321743011475", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "